{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5c1b9f13-5800-4481-b4a1-e0010f995467",
    "name": "Payment Order Platform",
    "description": "Complete smoke test collection for the Payment Order Platform.\n\n**Run order:**\n1. Auth → get token\n2. Wallet Setup → top-up wallet BEFORE creating any order\n3. Inventory → verify seed data\n4. Happy Path Saga → full flow\n5. Compensation sagas as needed\n\n**Environment variables required:**\nbase_url, keycloak_url, realm, client_id, username, password, customer_id\n\n**Auto-saved by tests:**\ntoken, order_id, order_id_oos, order_id_insuf, wallet_id",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Get Keycloak Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.test('Token received', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "console.log('Token saved:', json.access_token ? 'OK' : 'FAILED');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
                { "key": "client_id",  "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "username",   "value": "{{username}}" },
                { "key": "password",   "value": "{{password}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": ["{{keycloak_url}}"],
              "path": ["realms","{{realm}}","protocol","openid-connect","token"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
